    <item>
      <title>法官命令特朗普官员透露 18 亿美元基金设立者的姓名</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-administration-fund-compensation-jan-6.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[设立一个基金的计划可以将纳税人的钱输送给总统的盟友，这一计划引起了反复的审查，包括来自参议院共和党人的罕见谴责。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-administration-fund-compensation-jan-6.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:52:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>林赛·克兰西谋杀案审判以陪审团悬而未决而告终。现在怎么办？</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/lindsay-clancy-murder-hung-jury-what-next.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[克兰西女士仍因杀害她的三个孩子而面临谋杀指控。她很可能会留在医院，检察官可能会决定对她进行重审。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/lindsay-clancy-murder-hung-jury-what-next.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:31:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
